Dear Keith,
  Here is the stuff I mentioned which comes from Matt Jacobs 
  who was once at dual systems. I am using it with 2.10 so
  that I can access 18-bit tm11 tape drive (cipher 910 via
  western digital tc-151) in an otherwise 22bit environment.
  I define SOFUB_MAP, SOME18BIT as well as Q22, for reasons
  which should be clear below.  I put my defines in a separate
  "jpn.h" just to keep from recompiling everything dependent
  on param.h.

